  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Salmorejo is simpler than gazpacho but richer. The key is to drizzle in the olive oil slowly while blending to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "emulsify",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "emulsify"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " it into the tomato, giving the soup its thick, velvety texture. You can add "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "crouton ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "crouton"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "s alongside if you like extra crunch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Only use very ripe tomatoes. Under-ripe tomatoes will make the soup sour and thin."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
