              "symptom": "Tastes bitter",
              "cause": "Garlic too strong or tomatoes not ripe",
              "fix": "Use half a clove of garlic and only the ripest tomatoes."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "troubleshooterItem",
            "attrs": {
              "symptom": "Not smooth enough",
              "cause": "Not blended long enough",
              "fix": "Blend for at least 2 minutes on high and pass through a fine sieve."
